            $TRANS$• Permuterm index – does not require postfiltering (a filter to check the compatibility of the original query). Spelling correction allows you to correct errors in the user's query. In the following example, is there a mistake? Calculating the distance form Tel-aviv to Haifa There are two methods for correcting mistakes: • Handling an isolated word We will use a dictionary of "correct" words to check our word. - Using a standard dictionary. - Use of words found in our documents. In correcting an isolated word, we will measure distance, measure how close the word in the user's query is to the words in the dictionary.$TRANS$
