            $TRANS$BSBI (Blocked Sorted Based Indexing) Algorithm n holds the number of blocks. daysm616sec053200000000log*000,000,100*2*10 1000000000 2 == We have documents that have not yet been processed and we would like to start reading the words from it, the documents are on a disk, we will read a block of data from a document and we will retrieve the concepts. We will read the documents until the block is filled, if the document is larger than the block size, we will read part of it. When the block has been filled in the working memory, we will sort the document in the working memory and write to the disk until all the documents have been processed. Until finally we merge the blocks.$TRANS$
