            82,
            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "סיכום למבחן אחזור מידע (1).pdf", "file_type": "pdf", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "3ff93c29-914b-410f-b28e-cb8300b263e4", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "de0ff05457533c93fdf3e0d1cdd0f808", "create_date": "2025-08-26T11:29:00.335Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/de0ff05457533c93fdf3e0d1cdd0f808/data/1756207659351-0c8cd1917d00e951630029e4978e9147.pdf", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: אלגוריתם, מסמכים, קבוצות, מובילים, חישוב קוסינוס"}}'::jsonb,
            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.335000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The algorithm takes all the documents and divides them into groups of (the number of groups is the number of the root of the number of documents), for example we have 100 documents we will have 10 groups, with each group having documents that are close to each other. At this stage, there is no division into groups yet, so we will choose from among the 100 documents, ( ) 10 documents randomly, we will call these documents leading. For each remaining document, we will calculate its degree of proximity to the movers we have chosen, for example by calculating cosine. We will attach each document to the nearest carrier, and from this we will create groups that will be close to the leading documents.$TRANS$
