            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "סיכום למבחן אחזור מידע (1).pdf", "file_type": "pdf", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "5bc7e3ff-5469-4f41-93b6-9123d6909da2", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "de0ff05457533c93fdf3e0d1cdd0f808", "create_date": "2025-08-26T11:29:00.329Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/de0ff05457533c93fdf3e0d1cdd0f808/data/1756207659351-0c8cd1917d00e951630029e4978e9147.pdf", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: posting list, מסמך, שאילתה, משקל, נורמליזציה"}}'::jsonb,
            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.329000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The advantage of the posting list structure is more efficient, because it directly points to the document in which it appears. In the frequency matrix there is a lot of unnecessary information for a particular query, what is important to us is the relationship between the query and the word in the dictionary. Posting list is an advantage in this regard. 5. Calculate the weight of the word in the query and the weight of the word in the document, multiplying and naming it in the relevant cell of the document. 6. We will connect all the weights and get a score in the relevant cells. 7. Read the set of lengths 8. We will normalize (we will not normalize in advance and calculate) first we will use the dumbbells without normalizing. 9.$TRANS$
