            $TRANS$We talked about 3 metrics: • Accuracy: doesn't measure well in the world of search engines. Most of the documents are not relevant to the query. • Precision: We will check from the documents that have been returned. • Recall: We will check from the relevant documents. We have seen that between the metrics Precision and recall are opposite to each other – the more documents we return, the greater the chance of bringing relevant documents (the greater the recall will be), the denominator does not change, only the counter changes.$TRANS$
