            485,
            81,
            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "סיכום למבחן אחזור מידע (1).pdf", "file_type": "pdf", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "d36a7e2a-1f52-4025-9b89-d5015b20b90f", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "de0ff05457533c93fdf3e0d1cdd0f808", "create_date": "2025-08-26T11:29:00.351Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/de0ff05457533c93fdf3e0d1cdd0f808/data/1756207659351-0c8cd1917d00e951630029e4978e9147.pdf", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: מסמכים, זבל, recall, Precision, רלוונטיים"}}'::jsonb,
            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.351000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The fewer documents we return, the lower the chance of returning junk (this can be compared when we do work quickly, the higher the chance of errors), in recall, the less we return, the lower the chance that we will return relevant, so the metrics are opposite to each other. Intuitive explanation of Precision: • Only a few of the documents are relevant. • The Precision is calculated from the retrieved documents. • Assuming that the number of relevant documents returned does not change dramatically (since there are few of them), the more documents are returned, the higher the proportion of relevant documents out of the returned documents.$TRANS$
